    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-23" id="fn-23" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Percent of voting stock owned - All percentages as of December 31, 2025.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-24" id="fn-24" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Percent of voting stock owned - All percentages as of December 31, 2025.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-25" id="fn-25" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Tallgrass Energy Partners, LP owns 100% of Tallgrass MLP Operations, LLC, which owns 100% of Tallgrass Cheyenne Connector Holdings, LLC. Tallgrass Cheyenne Connector Holdings, LLC owns 50% of Cheyenne Connector, LLC. All percentages as of December 31, 2025.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-26" id="fn-26" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Transferred to Account No. 211, Miscellaneous Paid-in Capital.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-27" id="fn-27" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Transferred to Account No. 211, Miscellaneous Paid-in Capital.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-28" id="fn-28" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">General Plant reported does not include an allocation of corporate facilities to or from Tallgrass Energy Partners, LP ("TEP") and affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-29" id="fn-29" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents the Annual Charge Adjustment ("ACA"), which is an annual fee charged by the FERC and recovered from the shippers.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-30" id="fn-30" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Cheyenne Connector remeasured its accumulated deferred income taxes (Account 282 and 283) during the year ended December 31, 2023 based on the new tax rates stemming from a change in ownership, which resulted in the entity no longer being classified as a Master Limited Partnership. The remeasurement resulted in an increase in the accumulated deferred income tax asset. This adjustment was recorded in Account 182.3, Other Regulatory Assets. The balance is amortized to Account 410.1, Provision of Deferred Income Taxes, over the estimated remaining useful life of the pipeline.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-31" id="fn-31" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents over collections pursuant to Cheyenne Connector's tarrif Lost and Unaccounted-for Gas tracking mechanisms.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-32" id="fn-32" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Fuel recovery volumes (shipper supplied gas for Lost and Unaccounted-for): 0</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-33" id="fn-33" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Fuel recovery volumes (shipper supplied gas for Lost and Unaccounted-for): 0</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-34" id="fn-34" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Fuel recovery volumes (shipper supplied gas for Lost and Unaccounted-for): 0</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-35" id="fn-35" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Many of the natural gas volumes required to be reported on this page are tracked at the entity level, rather than by service type (i.e. firm transport, interruptible transport, etc.) or by discounted, negotiated, or recourse rate contracts and, therefore, the amounts reported have been allocated to the service types and to discounted, negotiated or recourse rate contracts based on reasonable assumptions.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-36" id="fn-36" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The cost rate percentage shown for common equity was used to calculate the rates approved in CP18-102-000</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-37" id="fn-37" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Tallgrass Energy Partners, LP and Phillips 66 are the source entities for the capital structure based on their respective ownership percentages.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-38" id="fn-38" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Fixed asset method is used for gas stored (lines 1 through 6).</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-39" id="fn-39" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Transferred to Account No. 211, Additional Paid in Capital.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-40" id="fn-40" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Transferred to Account No. 211, Additional Paid in Capital.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-41" id="fn-41" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Information provided represents general ledger dollar amounts and production month volumes.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-42" id="fn-42" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are based on direct distribution of labor charges from Tallgrass Cheyenne Connector Operator, LLC.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-43" id="fn-43" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are for direct distribution of insurance costs from Tallgrass Cheyenne Connector Operator, LLC.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-44" id="fn-44" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are based on direct vehicle costs from Tallgrass Cheyenne Connector Operator, LLC.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-45" id="fn-45" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged represent a fixed management fee of approximately $0.9 million per year charged by Tallgrass Cheyenne Connector Operator, LLC.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-46" id="fn-46" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are based on cell phone costs from Tallgrass Cheyenne Connector Operator, LLC.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-47" id="fn-47" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">All horsepower is site rated based on elevation.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-48" id="fn-48" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Single day peak delivery was 10/16/2025</link:footnote>
